cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LMU USM AI Agent Configuration Template"
abstract: >
  A template repository for using GitHub Copilot (and other AI coding agents)
  in a reproducible, citable, and policy-compliant way in astrophysics research.
  Includes group-wide Copilot instructions, specialist agents and skills,
  literature search (NASA ADS MCP), pre-commit hooks,
  and a conda environment covering the standard astro-Python stack.
message: >
  If you use or adapt this template in published work, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
type: software
